---
---

<!-- El Método Valeria+: Bento Grid Asimétrico de 3 Pilares Clínicos -->
<section id="metodo" class="what-section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-header">
      <span class="tag">Principio Clínico & Método</span>
      <h2>El Método Valeria+: <span class="gradient-text">Aprender antes de ejercitar</span></h2>
      <p>Capacitación parental previa para modelar el lenguaje en la rutina diaria, seguida de estimulación lúdica guiada por Lúa.</p>
    </div>

    <!-- Asymmetric Bento Grid (3 Core Pillars) -->
    <div class="bento-pillars-grid">
      <!-- Pillar 1: Hero Bento Card (Spans full width or large anchor) -->
      <article class="glass-card bento-card bento-featured">
        <div class="bento-badge-row">
          <span class="badge badge-purple">
            <svg width="13" height="13" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
              <path d="M4 19.5A2.5 2.5 0 0 1 6.5 17H20"></path>
              <path d="M6.5 2H20v20H6.5A2.5 2.5 0 0 1 4 19.5v-15A2.5 2.5 0 0 1 6.5 2z"></path>
            </svg>
            <span>Pilar Fundamental</span>
          </span>
          <span class="bento-micro-kpi">Academy Parental</span>
        </div>

        <div class="bento-content">
          <div class="icon-wrapper purple">
            <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
              <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle>
              <polygon points="10 8 16 12 10 16 10 8"></polygon>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3>1. Formar antes de ejercitar</h3>
          <p class="bento-lead-text">
            Las madres, padres y cuidadores asimilan técnicas profesionales de modelado verbal positivo (<em>recast</em>) y alternancia de turnos, eliminando la frustración y reforzando cada logro en casa.
          </p>
          <div class="bento-highlights">
            <span class="highlight-chip">Cápsulas clínicas directas</span>
            <span class="highlight-chip">Sin corrección punitiva</span>
            <span class="highlight-chip">Transferencia al juego real</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>

      <!-- Pillar 2: Clinical Adult Judgment (MDR) -->
      <article class="glass-card bento-card">
        <div class="bento-badge-row">
          <span class="badge badge-cyan">
            <svg width="13" height="13" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
              <path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"></path>
            </svg>
            <span>MDR SaMD Clase I</span>
          </span>
        </div>
        <div class="icon-wrapper cyan">
          <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
            <path d="M20 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H8a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"></path>
            <circle cx="12" cy="7" r="4"></circle>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3>2. Criterio humano al mando</h3>
        <p>
          Cero diagnósticos automáticos opacos. El reconocimiento de voz apoya en el dispositivo, pero el adulto siempre tiene la última palabra para validar o matizar cada fonema.
        </p>
        <span class="card-footer-pill">Supervisión Médica & Familiar</span>
      </article>

      <!-- Pillar 3: Offline Privacy (Zero-PHI) -->
      <article class="glass-card bento-card">
        <div class="bento-badge-row">
          <span class="badge badge-emerald">
            <svg width="13" height="13" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
              <rect x="3" y="11" width="18" height="11" rx="2" ry="2"></rect>
              <path d="M7 11V7a5 5 0 0 1 10 0v4"></path>
            </svg>
            <span>Privacidad Absoluta</span>
          </span>
        </div>
        <div class="icon-wrapper emerald">
          <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
            <path d="M1 1l22 22"></path>
            <path d="M16.72 11.06A10.94 10.94 0 0 1 19 12.55"></path>
            <path d="M5 12.55a10.94 10.94 0 0 1 5.17-2.39"></path>
            <path d="M10.71 5.05A16 16 0 0 1 22.56 9"></path>
            <path d="M1.42 9a15.91 15.91 0 0 1 4.7-2.88"></path>
            <path d="M8.53 16.11a6 6 0 0 1 6.95 0"></path>
            <line x1="12" y1="20" x2="12.01" y2="20"></line>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3>3. 100% Offline (Zero-PHI)</h3>
        <p>
          Los modelos neuronales operan exclusivamente en local. Las grabaciones de voz infantil nunca se almacenan ni se transmiten a la nube.
        </p>
        <span class="card-footer-pill">Sin Nube · Cero Rastreo</span>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .what-section {
    padding: 85px 0;
    position: relative;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border-light);
  }

  .bento-pillars-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.25fr 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 1.5rem;
    max-width: 1120px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .bento-card {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    padding: 2.25rem 2rem;
    height: 100%;
    position: relative;
    transition: transform 0.25s ease, border-color 0.25s ease, box-shadow 0.25s ease;
  }

  .bento-card:hover {
    transform: translateY(-3px);
    border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);
  }

  .bento-featured {
    background: linear-gradient(145deg, rgba(30, 27, 75, 0.45) 0%, rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.8) 100%);
    border: 1px solid rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.35);
    box-shadow: 0 15px 35px -10px rgba(138, 43, 226, 0.15);
  }

  .bento-badge-row {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    width: 100%;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .bento-micro-kpi {
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #c084fc;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .icon-wrapper {
    width: 50px;
    height: 50px;
    border-radius: 14px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .icon-wrapper.purple {
    background: rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.12);
    color: #c084fc;
    border: 1px solid rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.35);
  }

  .icon-wrapper.cyan {
    background: rgba(0, 242, 254, 0.1);
    color: var(--accent-cyan);
    border: 1px solid rgba(0, 242, 254, 0.3);
  }

  .icon-wrapper.emerald {
    background: rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.12);
    color: #6ee7b7;
    border: 1px solid rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.35);
  }

  .bento-card h3 {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
    color: var(--text-main);
  }

  .bento-card p {
    color: var(--text-muted);
    font-size: 0.92rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin: 0;
    flex-grow: 1;
  }

  .bento-lead-text {
    font-size: 0.96rem !important;
    line-height: 1.65 !important;
  }

  .bento-lead-text em {
    color: #c084fc;
    font-style: normal;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .bento-highlights {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    margin-top: 1.5rem;
  }

  .highlight-chip {
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--text-main);
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-light);
    border-radius: var(--radius-full);
    padding: 0.3rem 0.75rem;
  }

  .card-footer-pill {
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--text-dim);
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    margin-top: 1.5rem;
    display: inline-block;
  }

  @media (max-width: 960px) {
    .bento-pillars-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 1.25rem;
    }

    .bento-card {
      padding: 1.75rem 1.5rem;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .what-section {
      padding: 50px 0;
    }

    .bento-card {
      padding: 1.5rem 1.25rem;
    }

    .bento-card h3 {
      font-size: 1.15rem;
    }

    .bento-card p {
      font-size: 0.88rem;
    }
  }
</style>
